# The marveen user's crontab lines that must survive a container recreate.
# Restored on every start by scripts/crontab-ensure.sh (missing lines only).
# This file is the source: change a time HERE, not in the live crontab. A line edited only
# in the crontab no longer matches, so the original comes back next to it on the next start.
# Backups run from cron, not from an agent session: see scripts/mentes-cron.sh.
40 3 * * * /home/marveen/marveen/scripts/mentes-cron.sh fleet
30 4 * * * /home/marveen/marveen/scripts/mentes-cron.sh ai
30 5 * * 0 /home/marveen/marveen/scripts/mentes-cron.sh proba
# Idle-path channel keepalive (no systemd in the container, so the .timer never runs). Without
# it a quiet night leaves store/.channel-keepalive stale and the watchdog respawns the main
# session every 15-20 min (measured 2026-10-17 00:34-02:46, five fresh sessions).
*/3 * * * * /home/marveen/marveen/scripts/channel-keepalive-probe.sh >/dev/null 2>&1
# Sutyerák production gateway keepalive (loopback 3430). Lost in a container recreate
# and nothing restored it: staff got "Sutyerák most nem tud válaszolni" (measured 2026-10-21).
* * * * * /home/marveen/sutyerak/run-gateway.sh
# Idle and fleet-lock watchdog (not an LLM): every ten minutes between 08 and 24 it tells acrobot
# who has stood idle, or waited on /tmp/flotta-nehez.lock, longer than 20 minutes. Missing since the
# 2026-10-13 container recreate because it was only in the live crontab (acrobot 43759, 2026-11-05:
# Balázs asked why he has to ask whether anyone is working).
*/10 8-23 * * * /home/marveen/marveen/scripts/tetlen-or.sh 20 >>/home/marveen/marveen/store/tetlen-or.log 2>&1
# Memory guard (not an LLM, task flotta-memoria-or): every minute, round the clock. Under memory pressure it stops one
# idle agent (lowest priority first, never acrobot); after 10 minutes above 2.5 GB free it starts back the ones it
# stopped. 2026-11-06 12:1x the box ran out of memory beside six claude sessions.
* * * * * /usr/bin/python3 /home/marveen/marveen/scripts/memoria-or.py >>/home/marveen/marveen/store/memoria-or.log 2>&1
